WEBVTT

00:05:29.047 --> 00:05:31.603
Ya’ni 1 kursda o'qiyotgan
tibbiyot talabasi,

00:05:31.627 --> 00:05:35.015
turli xil kasalliklar va ularning
belgilarini o’qib,

00:05:35.039 --> 00:05:37.270
ularning barchasini o’zida topadi.

00:05:37.294 --> 00:05:38.295
(Kulgi)

00:05:38.319 --> 00:05:41.391
Mening kiyovim Bobo esa,
umuman boshqa hikoya.

00:05:41.415 --> 00:05:42.977
Bobo Emi-muhrga uylangan.

00:05:43.001 --> 00:05:44.733
Bir kuni u menga telefon qilib -

00:05:44.757 --> 00:05:46.902
(Kulgi)

00:05:46.926 --> 00:05:48.976
Yelning tibbiyot universitetidan,

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:51.281
va shunday dedi: “Sho’n, menda moxov bor!”

00:05:51.305 --> 00:05:52.976
(Kulgi)

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.587
Bu kamdan-kam uchraydigan kasallik,
hatto Yelda ham.

00:05:55.611 --> 00:05:57.976
Lekin uni qanday qilib ovutishni bilmadim,

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.858
chunki u yaqindagina 1 haftalik
menopauzani boshdan kechirdi.